export anchor Padding:
    description:
        Shorthand for the four padding sides: the space between the component's content and its border. One value sets all sides; two set top/bottom then left/right; three set top, left/right, bottom; four set top, right, bottom, left.

    identifier: padding

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `padding` property.

    values:
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`
        - `<top> <right>? <bottom>? <left>?`

    initial: 0

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            padding: 8px 12px
        \\\
        ```
